                        <String CONTENT="to be accepted into his regiment, and stating that if we did not consent, he"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l30" HPOS="387" VPOS="2189" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="389 2232 2155 2228" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="389 2232 389 2246 2153 2246 2155 2228 2151 2201 2063 2189 2061 2189 2059 2189 2032 2199 1773 2189 1771 2189 1769 2189 1740 2199 1713 2189 1711 2189 1709 2189 1619 2199 1562 2189 1561 2189 1559 2189 1537 2199 1426 2189 1424 2189 1422 2189 1381 2199 1348 2189 1346 2189 1344 2189 1089 2201 1025 2191 1023 2191 1021 2191 991 2201 607 2191 606 2191 541 2201 477 2191 475 2191 387 2203 389 2232"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="would order all of us to be exterminated. Then he took from us by force"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l31" HPOS="385" VPOS="2248" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="387 2293 2155 2287" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="387 2293 387 2306 2153 2304 2155 2287 2151 2259 2096 2248 2095 2248 2093 2248 2067 2258 1981 2248 1980 2248 1929 2258 1904 2248 1902 2248 1900 2248 1898 2248 1896 2248 1880 2259 1790 2259 1736 2248 1734 2248 1676 2258 1615 2248 1613 2248 1492 2259 1101 2250 1099 2250 1097 2250 1095 2250 1079 2259 496 2252 494 2252 493 2252 461 2261 409 2252 407 2252 405 2252 403 2252 385 2259 387 2293"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the inspecting official Semen Motora, and put him into the stocks for nine"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l32" HPOS="387" VPOS="2310" WIDTH="1762" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="389 2351 2149 2347" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="389 2351 389 2367 2145 2373 2149 2347 2145 2312 407 2310 405 2310 403 2310 401 2310 387 2316 389 2351"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="days, and extorted from him a paper promising to remain under his (Michael’s)"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l33" HPOS="389" VPOS="2373" WIDTH="250" HEIGHT="54" BASELINE="389 2410 639 2410" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="389 2410 389 2427 639 2427 639 2410 637 2373 389 2380 389 2410"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="command.”"/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l34" HPOS="491" VPOS="2425" WIDTH="1662" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="493 2472 2153 2468" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="493 2472 493 2486 2151 2486 2153 2468 2151 2439 2120 2425 2118 2425 2116 2425 2114 2425 2081 2439 1831 2439 1775 2425 1773 2425 1771 2425 1750 2437 1734 2425 1732 2425 1730 2425 1674 2425 1672 2425 1670 2425 1644 2439 1409 2439 1352 2425 1350 2425 1348 2425 1301 2439 1227 2427 1225 2427 1085 2437 1046 2427 1044 2427 1042 2427 1040 2427 1038 2427 1025 2437 999 2427 997 2427 995 2427 993 2427 970 2439 843 2427 841 2427 839 2427 837 2427 822 2439 748 2427 746 2427 744 2427 742 2427 724 2441 545 2441 508 2427 506 2427 504 2427 502 2427 500 2427 491 2435 493 2472"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="It seems that Michael Stadukhin could not accomplish his purpose. So"/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l35" HPOS="496" VPOS="2534" WIDTH="1532" HEIGHT="43" BASELINE="498 2560 2028 2563" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="498 2560 496 2573 2024 2577 2028 2563 2026 2538 498 2534 498 2560"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="¹ An official of this kind was added to cossack parties to collect tribute and to take care of it."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l36" HPOS="498" VPOS="2583" WIDTH="497" HEIGHT="39" BASELINE="498 2606 995 2606" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="498 2606 498 2622 995 2622 995 2606 995 2583 498 2583 498 2606"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="² Supplements, IV, pp. 9-27."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l37" HPOS="1157" VPOS="2583" WIDTH="302" HEIGHT="45" BASELINE="1157 2606 1459 2606" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="1157 2606 1157 2616 1276 2628 1278 2628 1459 2620 1459 2606 1459 2583 1157 2583 1157 2606"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="³ Compare p. 18."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l38" HPOS="498" VPOS="2622" WIDTH="1495" HEIGHT="41" BASELINE="498 2645 1993 2645" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="498 2645 498 2663 1993 2663 1993 2645 1993 2622 498 2622 498 2645"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="⁴ In these oldest reports Kolyma is often called “Kovyma”, and Anadyr is called “Anandyr.”"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l39" HPOS="498" VPOS="2665" WIDTH="1659" HEIGHT="41" BASELINE="498 2688 2157 2688" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="498 2688 498 2706 2157 2706 2157 2688 2155 2665 498 2665 498 2688"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="⁵ The name “Pahycha River” is repeated several times in the reports. The Pahycha River is said to be"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l40" HPOS="387" VPOS="2706" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="43" BASELINE="389 2733 2153 2729" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="389 2733 389 2745 2151 2749 2153 2729 2145 2706 387 2708 389 2733"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="rich in sables. Some recent scientists have suggested that this name may have referred to the Amur River,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l41" HPOS="389" VPOS="2747" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="45" BASELINE="391 2776 2155 2770" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="391 2776 391 2792 2153 2786 2155 2770 2149 2747 389 2751 391 2776"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="which in reality, even up to the present, abounds in sables; but the natives of the Kolyma hardly knew any-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l42" HPOS="391" VPOS="2790" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="42" BASELINE="393 2817 2157 2813" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="393 2817 393 2832 2155 2832 2157 2813 2149 2790 391 2792 393 2817"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="thing of the distant Amur. They had knowledge only of the nearest rivers, such as the Anadyr and the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l43" HPOS="389" VPOS="2832" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="43" BASELINE="391 2860 2157 2856" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="391 2860 391 2875 2155 2875 2157 2856 2149 2832 389 2832 391 2860"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Penshina. Of these rivers, the Anadyr is mentioned as being, even at that time, poor in sable. The next"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l44" HPOS="389" VPOS="2873" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="45" BASELINE="391 2903 2155 2897" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="391 2903 391 2916 2151 2918 2155 2897 2149 2873 389 2875 391 2903"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="large river is the Poqaˊč, which forms the northern boundary-line of the sable territory, and which even now,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l45" HPOS="391" VPOS="2914" WIDTH="1764" HEIGHT="47" BASELINE="393 2944 2155 2938" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="393 2944 393 2961 2153 2961 2155 2938 2149 2914 391 2918 393 2944"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="when the sable is rapidly vanishing in the north, still has some of the darkest and most valuable sables. It"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l46" HPOS="389" VPOS="2957" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="47" BASELINE="391 2986 2155 2981" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="391 2986 391 3002 2151 3004 2155 2981 2149 2957 389 2961 391 2986"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="is quite probable that the natives of the Kolyma, when speaking of Pahycha, had in mind this Poqaˊč River;"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l47" HPOS="391" VPOS="2992" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="55" BASELINE="393 3025 2159 3021" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="393 3025 393 3047 2157 3047 2159 3021 2153 2992 391 3000 393 3025"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="and also the Kolyma Cossacks, in their search for sable, wanted to find the said Poqaˊč, the boundary-line of"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-149_l48" HPOS="389" VPOS="3043" WIDTH="310" HEIGHT="45" BASELINE="391 3068 699 3066" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="391 3068 391 3088 697 3086 699 3066 693 3043 389 3043 391 3068"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the sable territory."/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock></PrintSpace>
